\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<h2 align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT OF RADIOLOGY &amp; IMAGINE<\/span><\/h2>\r\n\r\n<h1 align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>2-D COLOUR AND SPECTRAL DOPPLER\r\nSTUDY OF- UPPER LIMB<\/span><\/h1>\r\n\r\n<h1><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<u>ARTERY &amp; VENOUS<\/u><\/span><\/h1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>[Right \/ Left]<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<h3><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ARTERIES\r\nEXAMINED<\/span><\/u><\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>*\r\nSubclavian artery: <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>*\r\nAxillary artery:<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoBodyText><span lang=EN-US>* Brachial artery:<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>*\r\nUlnar artery:<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>*\r\nRadial artery.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>REPORT :<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoBodyText><span lang=EN-US>All arteries show normal flow spectrum\r\nwith peak systolic velocities within normal range. Diastolic forward flow is\r\npreserved. No significant luminal stenosis \/ localised turbulence noted.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoBodyText><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoBodyText><span lang=EN-US>Arterial wall is apparently normal with\r\nno obvious plaque lesion.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<h5><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-style:normal'>ARTERY\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nPSV\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 [cm\/Sec]\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 [PSV: - Peak systolic velocity]<\/span><\/h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<\/span><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<\/span><\/b><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Left<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacin